*     FAP                                                                       
       LBL     ISQRT                                                    ISQRT000
       COUNT   100                                                      ISQRT001
*      U. OF CHICAGO COMPLEX SQUARE ROOT SUBROUTINE                     ISQRT002
*      CALLING SEQUENCE                                                 ISQRT003
*        TSX   $ISQRT,4                                                 ISQRT004
*IMAGINARY PART OF THE ARGUMENT MUST BE LOCATED IN CELL 32766, AND THE  ISQRT005
*REAL PART IN CELL 32767.  BOTH MUST BE NORMAL, FLOATING POINT NUMBERS. ISQRT006
*IF /X/+/X+IY/ OVERFLOWS, EITHER IABS ERROR OR (FPT) ERROR WILL RESULT. ISQRT007
       SPACE                                                            ISQRT008
       ENTRY   ISQRT                                                    ISQRT009
 ISQRT SXA     SAVE4,4                                                  ISQRT010
       DLD     -2                                                       ISQRT011
       DST     BUFF          SAVE THE ARGUMENTS                         ISQRT012
       TSX     $IABS,4       FIND THE ABSOLUTE VALUE OF THE ARGUMENT    ISQRT013
       CLA     -1                                                       ISQRT014
       FAM     BUFF+1                                                   ISQRT015
       FRN                                                              ISQRT016
       SUB     K1            DIVISION BY 2 HERE                         ISQRT017
       TPL     *+3           IF UNDERFLOW OCCURS, ZERO THIS PART OF THE ISQRT018
       STZ     -1            ANSWER                                     ISQRT019
       TRA     SAVE4                                                    ISQRT020
       TSX     $SQRT,4       FIND SQUARE ROOT OF WORKS                  ISQRT021
       STO     -1            STORE TEMPORARILY IN TOP OF CORE           ISQRT022
       ADD     K1            MULTIPLY SAME BY 2 FOR DIVISION LATER      ISQRT023
       STO     -2            -2 USED FOR BUFFER SPACE                   ISQRT024
       CLA     BUFF                                                     ISQRT025
       FDP     -2                                                       ISQRT026
       XCA                                                              ISQRT027
       FRN                                                              ISQRT028
       STO     -2            SECOND PART OF THE ANSWER COMPUTED AND     ISQRT029
       CLA     BUFF+1        STORED.                                    ISQRT030
       TPL     SAVE4         IF X IS LESS THAN ZERO, PARTS MUST BE      ISQRT031
       DLD     -2            INTERCHANGED BEFORE STORAGE.               ISQRT032
       LRS     0             SOME SIGNS MUST BE CHANGED AS WELL         ISQRT033
       SSP                                                              ISQRT034
       XCA                                                              ISQRT035
       DST     -2                                                       ISQRT036
 SAVE4 AXT     **,4                                                     ISQRT037
       TRA     1,4                                                      ISQRT038
    K1 OCT     1000000000                                               ISQRT039
  BUFF BSS     2                                                        ISQRT040
       END                                                              ISQRT041
